    "title": "No. 16 Haddonfield moves to 3-0 with win over Collingswood - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n36 minutes ago Charlotte McLister and Grace Porter each found the back of the cage to lead Haddonfield, No. 16 in the NJ.com Top 20, to a 2-0 win over Collingswood in Collingswood. Avery McMaster added an assist for the Bulldawgs, who improved to 3-0. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
